  <!-- ── SECTION 9 ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="s9">
    <div class="section-tag">Alternative</div>
    <h2>9. VMware Player — The Alternative</h2>

    <h3>What Is VMware Player?</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>VMware Workstation Player</strong> (formerly VMware Player) is a Type 2 hypervisor produced by Broadcom (who acquired VMware in 2023). It was historically free for personal use, though licensing terms have changed in recent years. VMware is considered the industry-standard hypervisor in enterprise environments — its professional version (VMware Workstation Pro) is widely used by penetration testers and corporate IT departments.
    </p>

    <h3>VirtualBox vs VMware — Head-to-Head Comparison</h3>

